note Rosetta Code task "Loops/Foreach": https://rosettacode.org/wiki/Loops/Foreach
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
om2
text nl "\n"
note the collection: names separated by newlines
text fruit "apple\nbanana\ncherry\ndate\nelderberry\n"
note emit writes every byte of a to stdout; a short write is retried, an error exits 1
fn emit a view uchar * to void
o = ulong 0
while lt o len a bound 4096
k = write 1 a o sub len a o
if le k 0
exit 1
end
o = add o ulong k
end
end
note foreach visits every newline-terminated element of the collection in order
fn main to int
s = ulong 0
for i ulong len fruit
if eq get fruit i 10
emit part fruit s add sub i s 1
s = add i 1
end
end
ret 0
end
